what was supposed to be a saturday night  at a bar turned to tragedy for the  soweto family  suny sila golempi's 19 year old son  symptom bile was killed when three  gunmen entered the bar where he'd gone  to play pool  his family heard the gunshots from their  home  it's painful for me what happened to my  child really painful for me  and he was the only son in this home we  had high hopes for him  symptom billy was one of 15 people  killed at this bar most of them lived in  the area  the bar has now been closed as police  investigate what happened  they say they haven't yet established a  motive but many blame poor policing and  the proliferation of guns  timbit lamini lost both her son and  nephew in the attack she's too  devastated to talk  for people living in this area we hear  gunshots every day we live in fear every  day there is not a single day that  passes without us hearing gunshots  says people are buried every week  as shocking as the attack was for people  here it's not an isolated incident two  other bars were attacked in recent days  one in the kwazulu-natal province and  the other in a township east of  johannesburg more than 20 people were  killed  as a community reels in shock families  tried to absorb what's happened their  devastation worsened by the unaffordable  cost of bearing their loved ones familia  muller soweto south africa
 

